    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/94112efaa68164b3de5ef8eff107bee8.poster.avif?t=1754654287\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/94112efaa68164b3de5ef8eff107bee8.webm?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Make your Move, a combination and strategy roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Make your Move you must fight the shadows and defeat the void, for this you have a unique ability to generate cubes and rotate them to get different combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/feb10ae0f812839782c092e82796910a.poster.avif?t=1754654287\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/feb10ae0f812839782c092e82796910a.webm?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/feb10ae0f812839782c092e82796910a.mp4?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/76c4959e3b8aa917d60fd0669c47edb8.poster.avif?t=1754654287\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/76c4959e3b8aa917d60fd0669c47edb8.webm?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Your game, your decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game you play in Make your Move is different, with a randomised system, when you start it generates randomly, map, objects, equipment, enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/8117e67a6af8b13774b5d3cd2231d2c5.poster.avif?t=1754654287\" width=616 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/8117e67a6af8b13774b5d3cd2231d2c5.webm?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/8117e67a6af8b13774b5d3cd2231d2c5.mp4?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/aa7d688aa6801fce5033b9f84bd46808.poster.avif?t=1754654287\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636420/extras/aa7d688aa6801fce5033b9f84bd46808.webm?t=1754654287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Every cube counts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100</strong> different types of cubes each with their own unique effects, unlock them all to advance, improve your stats and make new combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=